msgid ""
"Step-by-step guides for managing snap packages, including updates, "
"interfaces, system options, services, and more for users and developers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:8
msgid "Manage snaps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:10
msgid ""
"Outside of whatever facilities a snapped application may provide, additional "
"snap functionality includes  data snapshots, usage quotas and control over "
"if and when a service runs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:12
msgid "System configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:14
msgid ""
"The snap system has been designed to look after itself with automatic "
"security and update policies. However, these elements, and many others, can "
"also be configured and managed manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:16
msgid ""
"{ref}`Connect interfaces <how-to-guides-work-with-snaps-connect-"
"interfaces>`: Control exactly what a snap can access, and what it can’t."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:17
msgid ""
"{ref}`Manage updates <how-to-guides-work-with-snaps-manage-updates>`: "
"Control when snaps update, or hold an update indefinitely ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:18
msgid ""
"{ref}`Configure snaps <how-to-guides-work-with-snaps-configure-snaps>`: "
"Learn how to set options for your servers and daemons."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:19
msgid ""
"{ref}`Configure the system <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-set-system-options>`: "
"The main way to configure your snapped applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:20
msgid ""
"{ref}`Apps and aliases <how-to-guides-work-with-snaps-apps-and-aliases>`: "
"Use your preferred names for your snapped applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:21
msgid ""
"{ref}`Control services <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-control-services>`: "
"Start, stop and restart snapped background service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:22
msgid ""
"{ref}`Validation sets <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-manage-validation-sets>`: "
"Ensure a defined set of snaps are installed and updated together."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/manage-snaps/index.md:24
msgid ""
"{ref}`Fix common issues <how-to-guides-fix-common-issues-index>`: If you do "
"run into problems, find common solutions here."
msgstr ""

